Package: diffutils
Version: 3.3-r0
Description: Diffutils contains tools used for finding differences between files
 Diffutils contains the GNU diff, diff3, sdiff, and cmp utilities. These
 programs are usually used for creating patch files.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv3+
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: diffutils
Depends: update-alternatives-opkg, libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: http://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/diffutils/diffutils-3.3.tar.xz file://run-ptest
